OL,3,ACharles sounded 'giddily elated' in
OL,4,Aphone call after Diana's death, her
OL,5,Abrother claims in new book
OL,6,
OL,7,FA new book by Diana's brother Earl
OL,8,FSpencer claims Charles was "giddily
OL,9,Felated" in a phone call to him after
OL,10,Fhis sister's death in 1997
OL,12,FHis claims in the book, being
OL,13,Fserialised in the Daily Mail, resulted
OL,14,Fin a strong rebuttal from Buckingham
OL,15,FPalace on Wednesday
OL,17,FIt comes on a day in which the King
OL,18,Fhosted a summit, warning of the
OL,19,F"existential dangers" of AI falling
OL,20,Finto the wrong hands
